  "properties": {
    "title": "Open-Source Solutions: Expanding our Humanity with Data Stories",
    "description": "Geospatial analysis welcomes an audience to interact with complex interactions and dynamic shifts in ecosystem balance. Location intelligence collected as data layers mirror a symphony or chapters in a book. We will explore the potential risks of vulnerable cities by exploring the environment, economics, built infrastructure, and how they intersect. We build the story or music over time while exploring the tensions we create. Let\u2019s examine the edges of eco-geomorphic frameworks and listen for a narrative.",
